repository-code: "https://github.com/okohlbacher/diaspextractor"
abstract: >-
  An open (BSD-3) extractor of pseudo-MS/MS spectra from Bruker timsTOF diaPASEF data, built on
  OpenMS, including an exact license-free TOF-to-m/z calibration derived from the acquisition's own
  MzCalibration table.
